# A signal to process 0 goes to every process in the caller's own group, the
# program that ran the line included, and one to a negative id goes to a
# whole group: both are `stop_system`, as is process 1. An id it cannot read
# for sure, and the ids a listing, a substitution or a file hands it, may be
# any process. An ordinary process and a job are safe.
